## Main outputs

Depending on the branch and run configuration, outputs include Cell Ranger `outs` directories and aggregated matrices; CellBender HDF5 matrices; QC PNGs, filtered `.h5ad` files and CSV summaries; doublet-call CSVs and annotated `.h5ad`/`.rds` objects; scVI parameter-screen AnnData objects; cluster composition/parameter CSVs; marker tables and figures; and a balanced-subsample AnnData object with UMAP and marker outputs. These are script-defined destinations, not evidence that outputs exist or that the scripts ran successfully. Most destinations are absolute paths under `/home/cv1u24`, `/iridisfs/home/cv1u24` or `/scratch/cv1u24` and need adaptation for another machine.

## Current status and limitations

The repository includes working-looking analysis scripts but no data, configuration files, dependency definitions or execution logs. `4_Sample_Integration` and `main` contain no integration code. Several doublet launchers call scripts not present in the branch. PATH02–PATH04 analyses create candidate cluster annotations based on marker overlap; these are not independently validated cell-type labels. The pooled scVI scripts assume prior preprocessing and integration and require consistent metadata (`sample`, `gist_subtype`) plus an `X_scVI` representation of the expected dimensionality. Spatial transcriptomics is maintained separately in `Preliminary_Spatial`; this repository does not perform spatial profiling.

For detailed methods and file-level descriptions, use the branch links in the table above.
